  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development Activities in OECD Work on Taxation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development Activities in OECD Work on Taxation covers a range of activies through which the OECD is seeking to extend the support it provides to developing countries in taxation issues, including increasing developing countries inclusion in the tax related standards, data and statistics of the OECD, and guidance and support on implementing international standards in tax.</narrative>
  </description>
